          "type": "output_text",
          "text": "One supplied test has an incorrect expected count: for `[9768663, 63434076]`, limit `1`, and suffix `\"111111\"`, only `10111111` and `11111111` qualify, so the answer is `2`, not `3`. Independent enumeration confirms this. I’ll correct that test and add brute-force checks before publishing.",
